{"The constructor null-checks `grantType` twice and never null-checks `rawTokenId`, which can allow a null raw token id to slip through and later cause unexpected NPEs when encoding or logging token IDs": 0.9662476181983948, "The access-token ID matcher uses substring indexes that don't align with the described 6-char prefix layout and the equality check is inverted (returns false when the shortcut matches), which can make tests pass/fail incorrectly and hide regressions": 0.9954326152801514, "`grantType` is captured once from `formParams` in the constructor, but `setFormParams(...)` only replaces `formParams` and does not update `grantType`. If any flow mutates/replaces form params after context creation, `getGrantType()` may return a stale value and the token ID encoding will carry incorrect grant context": 0.7749496102333069}